## 🎯 7. Recommendation to KhataPe

KhataPe should use AI to support monthly loan comparisons and preliminary financial analysis. Direct prompts are suitable for simple questions, while step-by-step calculations are more useful for complex decisions.

However, a human financial analyst must independently verify calculations, assess lending risks and ensure regulatory compliance before approving any loan product.

